          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uwa mbere ari na we w'imperuka, uwari warapfuye none akaba ari muzima aravuga aya magambo ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nzi amakuba yawe n'ubukene bwawe, (ariko rero uri umutunzi), n'uko utukwa n'abiyita Abayuda nyamara atari bo, ahubwo ari ab'isinagogi ya Satani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntutinye ibyo ugiye kuzababazwa. Dore Satani agiye gushyirisha bamwe muri mwe mu nzu y'imbohe kugira ngo mugeragezwe, kandi muzamara iminsi cumi mubabazwa. Ariko ujye ukiranuka uzageze ku gupfa, nanjye nzaguha ikamba ry'ubugingo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
